{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>When they come into the Tent of Meeting.</b> To offer the incense of the morning and the afternoon, or to sprinkle the blood of the bull of the anointed priest and the goats of idolatry." "<b>And they shall not die.</b> Thus if they do not wash, they die — for the Torah stated generalizations, and from the negative you infer the affirmative." "<b>To the altar.</b> The outer one, for there is no entry into the Tent of Meeting here but only in the courtyard."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 30, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:55:47.183006027Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}